<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened slightly against the dollar and the pound on Tuesday due to a scarcity of forex in the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 610.0380 against the dollar from 609.3450 and against the pound the shilling stood at a mean rate of 1001.5314 compared to 998.4149 on Monday.</p>
</text>
